</strong><em>(Working l&agrave; 33%, </em><em>tương đồng</em><em> với Sleeping ở mức 32%)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Pgg1dLsrtoW4jBxlj0llFegAgtg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng của Working v&agrave; Sleeping </strong><em>(Working </em><em><strong>tăng mạnh</strong></em><em> l&ecirc;n 42%)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ee7UdlbQ8o0eHvxDwgelUl3Wgbc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 3) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng của Sleeping </strong><em>(</em><em>ngược lại</em><em> Sleeping </em><em><strong>giảm mạnh</strong></em><em> xuống 25%)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HKUodfK9xogC0MxTp2Wlp70ng9f\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QcskdIE6RoFckExwCkClFQLsglf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-I5rjd2HMOohiGMxuCSjlbjzlgXg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 2</strong><strong>: Travelling to work, Relaxing at home, Going out, v&agrave; Others</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-I5rjd2HMOohiGMxuCSjlbjzlgXg\">\n<div>\n<div data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"0\" data-line=\"true\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 2 như sau:</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-B0iKdVLTxolzTuxkrUqlkKofguc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PZYadkY5hoW39nxJ2DclWxJBgWf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) <strong>So s&aacute;nh số liệu năm 1958</strong> <em>(Going out </em><em>chiếm</em><em> 19%, </em><em>trong khi</em><em> Relaxing at home and Others chỉ </em><em>chiếm<strong> </strong></em><em>8% v&agrave; 6%, v&agrave; 2% thời gian được d&agrave;nh cho Travelling to work)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WAJpdMTlcoTfoSxIhKKlcG0pgEe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) <strong>So s&aacute;nh số liệu năm 2008 của Travelling to work, Relaxing at home, Going out</strong> <em>(Thời gian Going out </em><em><strong>giảm mạnh</strong></em><em> xuống 6%, </em><em>trong khi<strong> </strong></em><em>Relaxing at home v&agrave; Travelling to work <strong>tăng</strong> l&ecirc;n 13% v&agrave; 8%)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Iru0d5KbooKvjxx8iDoll4YsgQh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 3) <strong>M&ocirc; tả số liệu của Others</strong> <em>(thời gian d&agrave;nh cho Others </em><em><strong>duy tr&igrave;</strong></em><em> <strong>ổn định</strong> ở mức 6%)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RuxRdF0GuoF09YxnotEl2yn7gbj\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>5.</strong><strong> Gợi &yacute; paraphrasing</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E8TVdaTROorfxXxMBfGldJ6pgbd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FASwd2UiCoitfbxeuYllUMqJg2b\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TN6Fd9B0PohTNjxAWltlSG3sgUg\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MgpOdgFa5orVtdxiKOPliFF8gih\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AN9KdAyEQoBjPVxlFAfl8SdfgAc\">Khi muốn diễn đạt \"<strong>v&agrave;o năm 1958 v&agrave; 2008\"</strong>, thay v&igrave; d&ugrave;ng \"<strong>in 1958 and in 2008</strong>\", m&igrave;nh c&oacute; thể d&ugrave;ng \"<strong>over the 50-year period</strong>\" hoặc \"<strong>over the next five decades</strong>\" để c&acirc;u văn của m&igrave;nh đa dạng hơn nh&eacute;.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RUqjdCRWxoEIVsxwGB0lp7Obgzb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>V&iacute; dụ: </strong></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NxZWd82hvoXHvjx3D2ZlpE96gYd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-I4NWd47d6o9qNnxtidSlsnpKg8d\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Commuting and relaxing at home increased <strong>over the 50-year period.</strong></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DgkwdoU9Vo7Q7cxCNmOl10bsgRb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Over the next five decades</strong>, working hours increased significantly.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 479,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RucCd22olo62OlxMyThl65y8gzf\">The pie charts compare how working adults in a particular country spent their time on various daily activities in 1958 and 2008.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 13807,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 480,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Overview",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EbVgdAJUnoqAuKxpB6mlDZHUgKf\">Overall, while the proportions of time spent on working, commuting and relaxing at home increased over the 50-year period, there were significant decreases in sleeping and going out hours, with other activities remaining unchanged. In addition, working hours consistently took up the largest share of the day.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 13807,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 481,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NVyvdKkkTo3MBSxd1lwl0ZUmgdh\">Regarding the two most time-consuming activities, working and sleeping took up similar proportions of the day in 1958, at 33% and 32% respectively. Over the next five decades, working hours increased significantly, accounting for 42% of people's daily time. In contrast, time spent sleeping decreased to one-quarter of the day by 2008.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 13807,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 482,
            "sort": 4,
            "name": "Body 2",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-O5JLdVvYpoYBYHxn0Tel8TnCgsc\">As for the remaining activities, going out with friends and family occupied 19% of the day in 1958, while relaxing at home and other activities took up much smaller proportions at 8% and 6% respectively, and only 2% was spent on travelling to work. By 2008, there was a dramatic fall in socializing time to just 6%, while both relaxing at home and commuting saw increases to 13% and 8% respectively. Meanwhile, the proportion of time dedicated to other activities remained stable at 6% throughout the period.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 13807,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          }
        ],
